WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Manon recovers while Ryu falls from medium Dégagé in the corner.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.570
Standing medium punch deliberately misses during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:02.350
Light Manège Doré catches Ryu on wake-up.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.250
The command grab slams Ryu and increases Manon’s medal counter to two.

5
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.250
Manon recovers next to the cornered Ryu.
